      "value": "@{5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad|full_name}: No one cares if its only accessible on Steam. Minecraft is available on every console and phone but you can only mod Java PC, it doesn't matter if no one else can use it.\nQuest can't even see a majority of the game. The inferior version already exists. \nIts already viable enough to enable workshop\nThe Framework already exists and it can help allow more tools without effort of the developer, this can let VRChat florish rather than choke on  its reliance on the developers exclusively\nThis is the PC environment, mods support is the standard",
